      "summaryMarkdown": "I verified all repairs against the committed delta through `86441c0`. All seven findings are resolved:\n- The macOS bench draws text through CoreText, and every text scenario has a glyph-covering floor (60 a frame for the scroll scenarios).\n- The baseline was recaptured from the clean commit `24d413c`, with medians.\n- The cached-view hover dependency is declared gpux behaviour in every mode. A frame that replayed a stale hover is drawn again before it is shown, without notifying the view's observers or waking the platform, and the oracle covers this case.\n- OR-1 now has per-event-type listener counts and mutation cases for screen-effect requests.\n- `cargo fmt --check` passes, and all 9 checks pass.",
      "findingIds": [
        "s01-bench-paints-no-glyphs",
        "s01-baseline-provenance",
        "s01-hover-fix-off-path-contract",
        "s01-oracle-description-gaps",
