      "descriptionMarkdown": "**Resolved.** `perf fast-mode` now records `Tree: clean|N uncommitted changes` from `git status --porcelain`, and this is tested in `fast_mode_report.rs`.\n\nThe baseline was recaptured at `24d413c` with `Tree: clean`, and `docs/fast-mode.md` names `24d413c`. The only later change, `88326e6`, touches `docs/fast-mode.md` alone, so `24d413c` is the measured source. The baseline also keeps `medians.txt`.",
