      "descriptionMarkdown": "**Resolved.** OR-1 was amended: the dispatch phase is a call argument, so listeners are described per event type.\n\n`Window::on_mouse_event`, the single registration site, records each listener's event type in test builds, and `reuse_paint` copies it. `describe_frame` emits the counts per type. New mutation cases cover:\n- the listener event type;\n- an active screen-effect request;\n- a screen-effect snapshot request.\n\nBoth requests are made real by playing a ripple and capturing a snapshot.",
